      "evidence_id": "ev-8207631370f079adc477a8c0",
      "path_or_url": "seedbank.md",
      "section": "Alder seed archive > Receiving envelopes",
      "snippet": "## Receiving envelopes\n\nHold incoming envelopes in the dry cabinet for nineteen days. Before shelving them, record two humidity readings at least four days apart, both below thirty percent. If either reading reaches thirty percent, restart the entire nineteen-day hold after drying; do not average the readings to authorize shelving. The [damaged seal rule](#damaged-seal-rule) overrides a completed hold.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "ddc850e26b8ec12c3a0173708f0cac461492202c27f1ebec499b1722edcfca23",
      "project_identity": "local:5ad3fb5d641ea1182cbe171babdcbd3282e5f1d8401e40f050ae60de7b8bd567",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 8,
