      "evidence_id": "ev-757b9360d857250b729f9976",
      "path_or_url": "seedbank.md",
      "section": "Alder seed archive > Damaged seal rule",
      "snippet": "## Damaged seal rule\n\nAn envelope with a split seal must be isolated in tray D and examined by the collection keeper before shelving, even when both humidity readings are below thirty percent.\n\n",
